<h3>🗂️ Java Cheat Sheet — Unit 2: Control Flow</h3>
<div class="vl-rule"><div class="t">WHAT'S INSIDE</div>
<table><tr><th>Part</th><th>Covers</th></tr>
<tr><td class="num">① if / else if / else</td><td>The grade-boundary pattern</td></tr>
<tr><td class="num">② switch</td><td>Works on int, char, String, enum — break or fall-through</td></tr>
<tr><td class="num">③ The three loops</td><td>while (pretest) · do-while (posttest, ≥ once) · for (known count) + for-each</td></tr>
<tr><td class="num">④ break &amp; continue</td><td>Exit vs skip-to-next</td></tr></table></div>
<div class="vl-ex"><div class="t">MOST-TESTED FACTS</div>
<table><tr><th>Fact</th><th>Value</th></tr>
<tr><td>Missing break in switch</td><td class="num">FALLS THROUGH to the next case</td></tr>
<tr><td>do-while</td><td class="num">Runs at LEAST once (posttest)</td></tr>
<tr><td>while</td><td class="num">May run ZERO times (pretest)</td></tr></table></div>
