<tr><td>Array size vs ArrayList size</td><td class="num">.length (FIELD) vs .size() (METHOD)</td></tr>
<tr><td>ArrayList holds</td><td class="num">Objects only (Integer, not int) — autoboxing</td></tr>
<tr><td>2D dimensions</td><td class="num">grid.length = rows · grid[0].length = columns</td></tr>
