:"Multiplication, not addition - the source of O(n squared) running time.","difficulty":"medium"},{"id":"zf677","topic":"","text":"for (int i = 2; i > 0; i--) { for (int j = 2; j > 0; j--) System.out.print(j); } prints:","options":["2121","1212","21","2211"],"correct":0,"explain":"Each outer pass prints the inner countdown 2,1 - twice in total.","difficulty":"medium"},{"id":"zf678","topic":"","text":"Comparing every element of one list against every element of another uses:","options":["a single loop","nested loops, one per list","two ifs","string concatenation"],"correct":1,"explain":"All-pairs work is inherently two-dimensional.","difficulty":"medium"},{"id":"zf679","topic":"","text":"The break statement inside an inner loop exits:","options":["both loops","the method","only the inner loop","the program"],"correct":2,"explain":"break leaves its nearest enclosing loop; the outer continues.","difficulty":"medium"},{"id":"zf680","topic":"","text":"int checker = 0; for (int r = 0; r < 3; r++) for (int c2 = 0; c2 < 3; c2++) if ((r + c2) % 2 == 0) checker++; System.out.println(checker); prints:","options":["4","9","5","3"],"correct":2,"explain":"On a 3x3 board the even-sum squares form the 5-square checkerboard color.","difficulty":"medium"}],"D286/u4/z4_9":[{"id":"zy4_9_0_q7","topic":"break vs continue","text":"break vs continue inside a loop: which exits the loop entirely?","options":["Both","Neither","break","continue"],"correct":2,"explain":"break exits the entire loop. continue skips current iteration only.","distractors":{"0":"continue stays in loop.","2":"Only break exits.","3":"break definitely exits."},"__rebal":1},{"id":"zy4_9_1_f14","topic":"break vs continue","text":"Which keyword exits the loop entirely?","options":["skip","break","return only","continue"],"correct":1,"explain":"break leaves the loop; continue only skips to the next iteration.","__rebal":1},{"id":"zy4_9_3_f22","topic":"continue target","text":"continue jumps to the loop’s:","options":["firs