n a printable String."},{"id":"zy6_19_10_lg_D286_1_63","topic":"NullPointer","text":"Calling a method on a null reference throws:","options":["NullPointerException","IOException","ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException","ClassCastException"],"correct":0,"explain":"Dereferencing null raises NullPointerException at runtime.","__rebal":1},{"id":"fs_z6_19_1","topic":"Changing state vs replacing the object","text":"What does this print?

