0
false","true
42
false"],"correct":3,"explain":"hasNextInt() reports whether the next token can be read as an int without consuming it. After 42 is read, the next token is abc, so the second test is false."},{"id":"fs_z9_1_6","topic":"print versus println","text":"What does this program print?

