4_1","topic":"Tracing entry and exit","text":"What does this program print?

static int fact(int n) {
    System.out.println("enter n=" + n);
    if (n <= 1) {
        System.out.println("base -> 1");
        return 1;
    }
    int r = n * fact(n - 1);
    System.out.println("exit n=" + n + " -> " + r);
    return r;
}

